7. Final Verification Flowchart

On a new system, follow this checklist to diagnose any issues quickly.

✅ Can WSL access the internet?

ping google.com

✅ Can Docker containers access the internet?

docker run --rm alpine nslookup google.com

If fails, run sudo /usr/local/bin/fix-docker-dns and test again.

✅ Are the background services running?

sudo systemctl status tika.service

sudo systemctl status cloudflared.service (once configured)

Both should be active (running).

✅ Are the containers running and networked?

docker ps (Should show tika-server and kiosk-app).

docker network inspect llm-net (Should show both containers listed).

✅ Is the application accessible?

Locally: Open a browser on Windows to http://localhost:8501.

Publicly: Open a browser to your Cloudflare Tunnel URL (llm.yourdomain.com).
